			title: "Fill a Standing Order — 24 Wheat for 8 Scrip"
			subtitle: "8 Scrip. Once."
			icon: "minecraft:wheat"
			description: ["Oda: \"One standing order, filled once. After that the wheat goes on my shelf and the Scrip comes out of your work, not my ledger.\"", "", "Put twenty-four wheat across the counter for eight Scrip, once. Every Scrip after this comes from deliveries, festival baskets and closing a neighbour's story."]
			x: 0.0d
